        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write your plans for next weekend and for your next holiday, using voy a.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Tell someone what you are going to do tomorrow, hour by hour."
